        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Meic Stevens, Jimmy Savile\n- Roles: DJ, singer-songwriter, television personality, radio personality, dance hall manager, charity fundraiser\n- Places: Wales, Manchester\n- Topics: discovery in music\n\nFacts:\n- Jimmy Savile was born on 31 October 1926 and died on 29 October 2011.\n- Jimmy Savile was an English DJ, television personality, radio personality, dance hall manager, and charity fundraiser.\n- In 1965, Jimmy Savile saw Meic Stevens performing in a Manchester folk club and discovered him.\n- Meic Stevens remained largely unknown outside Wales.",
